ommended dosage regimen of Paxlovid?\", \"required_output_fields\": [\"qid\", \"status\", \"answer\", \"citations\", \"structured_fields\"], \"set_id\": \"8a99d6d6-fd9e-45bb-b1bf-48c7f761232a\", \"task_type\": \"factual\"}\r\n{\"drug_name\": \"Paxlovid\", \"qid\": \"b54c25890c1ae3a6\", \"question\": \"How should Paxlovid be administered?\", \"required_output_fields\": [\"qid\", \"status\", \"answer\", \"citations\", \"structured_fields\"], \"set_id\": \"8a99d6d6-fd9e-45bb-b1bf-48c7f761232a\", \"task_type\": \"factual\"}\r\n"]
