[156.64488, "o", "            \"answer\": \"Important warnings and precautions associated with Paxlovid include: 1) Risk of serious adverse reactions due to drug interactions (as Paxlovid contains ritonavir, a strong CYP3A inhibitor); 2) Hypersensitivity reactions, including anaphylaxis and serious skin reactions such as toxic epidermal necrolysis (TEN) and Stevens-Johnson syndrome; 3) Hepatotoxicity, including hepatic transaminase elevations, clinical hepatitis, and jaundice; and 4) Risk of HIV-1 resistance development in individuals with uncontrolled or undiagnosed HIV-1 infection due to the ritonavir component.\",\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h"]
